  "Measured 23 Sep on a test gpu-pool node, same machine as prod (n1-standard-4 + T4): CPU is Intel Haswell at 2.30 GHz, 4 threads. Kubernetes shows 3.92 vCPU and 12.0 GB RAM (prod nodes were 12.1 GB) because it keeps 0.08 vCPU and about 3 GB for itself. The process can use all 4 threads. Scratch disk left after GKE was about 44 GB of the 100 GB disk.",
